# CVE-2026-59873 - tar DoS via crafted gzip bomb
# Bundled inside npm itself (comes with the node:20-alpine base image), not a direct app dependency.
# Confirmed with `npm ls tar` -> not used by this application.
# Not exploitable here: this app never extracts untrusted tar/gzip archives.
# Fix depends on upstream Node.js shipping an npm release with tar >= 7.5.19.
# Tracked upstream: https://github.com/npm/cli/issues/9801
# Revisit when Node.js ships a patched npm bundle.
CVE-2026-59873